course: dictionary
lesson: 8561
title: Scare: one word, many meanings
level: primary-4
stars: 1
explain: The word scare can be a verb, a noun, or part of a phrase. Look at the words around it to find the meaning that fits. «If a message scares you, show a grown-up.» Here scares means makes you feel afraid.
explain: A scare can also be a noun. It means a sudden fright, or a worry that many people feel about a danger. The word health in «a health scare» tells you the worry is about people's health.
explain: Small words that come with scare change its meaning. «Scared of» means afraid of something. «Scare away» means to frighten an animal or person so they go away. «Scared stiff» means very afraid. Learn these as chunks, not just single words.
fact: Scare is a verb (scare, scares, scared, scaring) and a noun (a scare, scares).
fact: «Scared» means afraid.
fact: To scare someone is to make them feel afraid.
fact: A scare is a sudden fright, or a worry that many people feel about a danger: a health scare.
fact: To scare away or off means to frighten an animal or person so they go away.
exercise: «Many people enjoy being scared by a film because it is a thrill with no real danger.» What does scared mean here? | Cold and wet | Tired and sleepy | Bored by the story | *Afraid
exercise: In nature, you may scare wild animals away by making noise. What does scare away mean? | To make the animal come closer | To paint the animal | *To frighten the animal so it goes away | To feed the animal
exercise: «The loud bang gave everyone a scare.» What is a scare here? | A bag of sweets | A type of dog | A new kind of film | *A sudden fright
test: «If the news about wars or fires scares you, ask an adult to explain.» What does scares mean? | Makes you feel hungry | *Makes you feel afraid | Makes you feel happy | Makes you feel sleepy
test: Ali was scared stiff when the lights went out. What does scared stiff mean? | *Very afraid | Very tired | Very quiet | Very cold
exam: Jumping out to scare people can hurt them, so prank only when it is safe. Why should you be careful with scare pranks? | Because they are boring | Because they make people laugh too much | Because they are against the rules of maths | *Because they can hurt people
